== Chateau de Sass ==

[[File:DQ6 Path to Chateau de Sass.jpg|thumb|right|Use Lorelei's Harp at point '''10''' to access the Chateau]]

[[File:DQ6 Chateau de Sass.png|thumb|right|Try to win the Plush Rug before you leave!]]

Like with Turnscote, Weaver's Peak, and Mt. Snowhere, you do not need to go here immediately; but you will need to at some point.  Besides that, you will also find your [[File:Dragon Warrior 3 SNES Small Medal.png]] <span style="color:green">71st Mini Medal</span> here; which means you can now get the Medal King Helm (75% resistance to death and status spells)!  As for the "Best-Dressed Contest", it is a fashion contest with prizes for all eight levels of competition.  They are as follows:

